tmux
====

macOS only. The prefix is C-Space (macos/tmux.conf.local). herdr replaces tmux on Linux.

SESSIONS AND CONFIG
  <prefix> C-c                  New session
  <prefix> C-f                  Switch to another session by name
  <prefix> e                    Edit ~/.tmux.conf.local with $EDITOR (vim when empty)
  <prefix> r                    Reload the configuration

WINDOWS AND PANES
  <prefix> C-h / <prefix> C-l   Previous / next window (<prefix> n and <prefix> p are
                                unbound)
  <prefix> Tab                  Last active window
  <prefix> h/j/k/l              Focus the pane left/down/up/right
  <prefix> H/J/K/L              Resize the pane
  <prefix> < / <prefix> >       Swap panes
  <prefix> +                    Maximize the pane to a new window
  <prefix> m                    Toggle mouse mode

COPY AND PASTE
  <prefix> Enter                Enter copy mode
  <prefix> b                    List paste buffers
  <prefix> p                    Paste the top buffer
  <prefix> P                    Choose a buffer to paste

TOOLS
  <prefix> U                    Urlview (if available)
  <prefix> F                    Facebook PathPicker (if available)
  C-l                           Clear the screen and the history
